<title>INDONESIA: Suharto leaves for Jordan, Italy.</title>
<headline>Suharto leaves for Jordan, Italy.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's President Suharto left on Monday for a state visit to Jordan and for a visit to Italy where he will attend a world food summit in Rome.</p>
<p>He was accompanied on his departure for Amman by State Secretary Murdiono and Foreign Minister Ali Alatas.</p>
</text>
